repository-code: 'https://github.com/mspencerchapman/mito_mutations'
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for the study of somatic mitochondrial DNA mutation, genetic
  drift and selection across human development and ageing. Includes the mtDNA
  mutation calling pipeline, mutational signature extraction, dN/dS selection
  analysis, and approximate Bayesian computation inference of mitochondrial
  drift rates through phylogenies of clonal expansions. The accompanying
  processed data is deposited at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22754723.
keywords:
  - mitochondrial DNA
  - heteroplasmy
  - somatic mutation
  - genetic drift
  - clonal haematopoiesis
  - phylogenetics
  - approximate Bayesian computation
license: CC-BY-4.0
